      "writtenOn": "2024-02-21T18:56:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "you can remove the string here, add a dependency on ANDROID_BINDERFS and change the default to yes. That way you can use CONFIG_ANDROID_BINDERFS_RUST in the Makefile without having to manually copy all the other config options when enabling the rust binder driver (this would also prevent creating a config that would make the rust/c runtime switch option you are adding also resulting switching between incompatible configs)",
      "revId": "015ac763b1a9eecea1fef4629112f539e7186fb9",
